po"><addressbook><name>FUKAYA YASUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUMIYA SADAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UNEME MASAYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAZAKI KAZUO</name><address><country>US</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKAYA, YASUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUMIYA, SADAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UNEME, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAZAKI, KAZUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An automatic washer for works, with which the chips adherent to a work due to an NC machining system is washed away prior to measuring the shape of the work with a three-dimensional measuring apparatus. To automatically drive the washer apparatus, a washing program is prepared by using a measurement PERT program for controlling the three-dimensional measuring apparatus, so that only required portions of the work are efficiently washed.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une laveuse automatique de pièces qui permet d'éliminer par lavage les particules adhérant à une pièce suite au traitement desdites pièces par un système d'usinage CN. Le lavage intervient avant la mesure de la forme de la pièce au moyen d'un appareil de mesure tridimensionnel. Le lancement automatique de la laveuse obéit à un programme de lavage établi sur la base d'un programme PERT de mesure, qui contrôle l'appareil de mesure tridimensionnel, pour laver de manière effective seulement les parties requises sur la pièce.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>